          "text": "Témoignages: BEAULIEU-SOUS-LA-ROCHE (85) 01.07.2017",
          "text_sha256": "aeff0f6850fe40472c9a2605b1de9a17a2aa7f3f1822376c2e84eca93b1378ae"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
